            "value": "Choose photos taken from the same viewpoint with about 30% overlap. The canvas is capped at 200 megapixels (larger sets scale down automatically), and the result is always cropped to the valid area."
          }
        },
        "zh": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择同一视点、重叠约 30% 以上的照片；画布上限 2 亿像素，超限自动等比缩小；结果恒自动裁去无效边缘。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
