            "value": "蒙版精细化失败，已保留快速蒙版"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "history_mask_refine": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Refine Mask Edge"
          }
        },
        "zh": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "精细化蒙版边缘"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mcp_tool_desc_refine_masks": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Refine the AI-generated raster masks of the editor's CURRENT image on a developed display guide (sample-based matting: hair, fur, branches, fine edges). Only the live editor image qualifies - relPath must name the image open in the editor right now; anything else fails typed. maskIds are the owning LAYERS' UUIDs whose masks were AI-generated; unknown or non-AI ids fail typed (nothing is silently dropped). Each refined raster replaces the quick one as ONE undoable history step; a failure keeps the quick mask. The pass runs in the background (seconds per mask): this call ENQUEUES and returns - poll render_preview afterwards to see the result. Serialized behind the render gate."
          }
        },
        "zh": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在显影后显示域向导图上精细化编辑器当前图像的 AI 蒙版(采样式抠图:发丝、毛发、枝叶等细边缘)。仅编辑器当前打开的图像可用——relPath 必须指向当前图像,否则 typed 报错。maskIds 为持有蒙版的图层 UUID;未知或非 AI 蒙版 typed 报错(不静默丢弃)。每个精细化栅格以一步可撤销 history 提交置换快速蒙版;失败保留快速蒙版。后台执行(每蒙版数秒):本调用入队即返回——随后用 render_preview 轮询结果。经渲染闸门串行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "settings_maskrefine_auto": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Refine AI mask edges automatically"
          }
        },
        "zh": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自动精细化 AI 蒙版边缘"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "settings_maskrefine_hint": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After an AI mask is generated its edges are refined against the developed image in the background (seconds per mask). A failure keeps the quick mask."
          }
        },
        "zh": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI 蒙版生成后,后台在显影图上精细化其边缘(每个蒙版数秒)。失败时保留快速蒙版。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
